<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="km">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kim Chi Shop</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#000;
color:white;
}

header{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
flex-direction:column;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000,#222,#000);
text-align:center;
}

h1{
font-size:55px;
color:gold;
animation:glow 2s infinite;
}

@keyframes glow{
0%{text-shadow:0 0 10px gold;}
50%{text-shadow:0 0 30px orange;}
100%{text-shadow:0 0 10px gold;}
}

p{
font-size:20px;
margin:20px;
}

.btn{
display:inline-block;
padding:15px 35px;
background:gold;
color:black;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:30px;
font-weight:bold;
transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
background:white;
transform:scale(1.1);
}

section{
padding:60px 20px;
text-align:center;
}

.card{
background:#111;
padding:20px;
border-radius:20px;
width:320px;
margin:auto;
box-shadow:0 0 20px gold;
}

.card img{
width:100%;
border-radius:15px;
}

.price{
font-size:30px;
color:gold;
margin:15px;
}

footer{
padding:30px;
text-align:center;
background:#111;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

<h1>សូមស្វាគមន៍</h1>

<p>មកកាន់ហាងលក់ គិម ឈី</p>

<a href="#product" class="btn">មើលផលិតផល</a>

</header>

<section id="product">

<div class="card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604908176997-431f2f2d6b31?w=600" alt="Kimchi">

<h2>គិម ឈី</h2>

<p>
រសជាតិឆ្ងាញ់ ស្អាត មានគុណភាព
</p>

<div class="price">
10,000៛ / 15,000៛
</div>

<p>
ម្ចាស់កម្មសិទ្ធិ<br>
<b>Kan Visal</b>
</p>

<p>
📞 090443460
</p>

<p>
Telegram<br>
@kanvisal77777
</p>

<a class="btn" href="https://t.me/kanvisal77777">
បញ្ជាទិញ
</a>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

© 2026 Kim Chi Shop | Kan Visal

</footer>

</body>
</html>
